  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "我跟大家宣布一件事，从今天开始，琳琳就是我们销售部的经理，大家鼓掌祝贺，谢谢王姐，也谢谢大家。王姐怎么了？我有件事想不明白，你说凭什么玲玲能当经理？我不能我俩可是同时进公司的，我每天来的比他早，走的比他晚，业务上我也没比他差。为什么这个位置不能让我来做？小张啊，你平时的努力大家都看得到，但是工作可不是光靠勤奋就能做好的那还要靠什么？正好明天李总那边有个项目要谈，你跟玲玲一起跟我去什么项目。一千万这个项目李总很重视，明天你俩都去。至于你刚才问我的问题，先别急，等这个项目结束以后，你自己告诉我答案。行，那我就看看我到底差在哪儿。李总，王姐一路辛苦了。关于这个项目的供应链充值，你们有什么具体方案，我们做了两套预案。一是通过集中采购，降低原材料成本。二是优化物流路线，预计能压缩百分之十五的损耗。小张啊，你是第一个十来分钟就能把项目谈下来的人，真是后生可畏啊，哪里哪里还是我们王姐厉害，我就是个打辅助的，好好合同，今天先不着急签，李总还有什么问题吗？没什么这么大的项目，我再考虑考虑。李总，这正好明天晚上，我组了个局陈，总也会过来。王姐要是有时间一起吃个饭，李总邀请，那肯定有时间。行，那项目的事儿，咱们明天再聊。王姐，刚才项目不是都已经谈好了吗？合同都准备签了，李总怎么突然又说要考虑你自己想想刚才说什么了，我也没说什么啊。李总夸我，我就是谦虚了一下，总不能人家夸我两句，我还真认了吧。李总夸你是认可你的能力，结果你倒好，自己先告诉人家，你就是个打辅助的这句话有什么问题。一千万的项目你自己都不敢认自己的能力，你让客户怎么放心？就因为这一句话，很多时候人家看的不只是你会不会做事，也看你会不会跟人打交道。那这个项目是不是没戏了？还有机会，这个项目光提成都不止一百万。李总既然没有直接拒绝，还主动约了明天的饭局，就说明事情还有转机，能不能把这个项目拿下来，就看你们两个明天的表现了哟。王姐来了，快坐快坐，不好意思，让两位久等了。哪里哪里都是自己人。小张啊，今天高兴，刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句。嗯，那祝大家吃好喝。好，我先干了王姐，那我也借这个机会说两句。好，你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，也感谢王姐带我们过来，让我们有幸认识各位前辈，我叫玲玲。俗话说，相聚是一种缘分。此时此刻，我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，祝各位扶摇直上。九万里，事业长虹节节高。好，这姑娘会说话，对不对？王姐，来这杯，我敬你。陈总，这杯我替王姐敬您，我敬的是你们领导，你是领导吗？瞧您说的，您敬的是我领导，我同样敬的也是领导，您敬领导是心意，我敬您是尊敬这杯，我敬的是生意，咱们随意，祝您生意一路长虹，万事顺利，这小姑娘会说话。琳琳刚才说的不错，来咱俩喝一个，谢谢陈总，怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。陈总瓶底酒，这叫发财酒，到底发财好事，再来好一个发财酒。琳琳，你这姑娘反应挺快，王姐手底下有你这样的员工省心啊。李总，您过奖了，主要是王姐平时带的好强将手下吴若兵，我总不能给我们王姐丢脸呀。王姐，你手底下这个姑娘不错，年轻人还得多跟您学习。啊啊啊王姐。李总，您说昨天那个一千万的项目，我考虑好了，项目可以继续合作。不过我有个条件，李总，您说这个项目后面我希望让琳琳来负责。李总，我对小张的业务能力没问题，这一点昨天我就看出来了，不过这么大的项目后面少不了跟各种人打交道。今天晚上我也一直在观察你们两个这个项目交给琳琳，我更放心，谢谢李总信任，也谢谢王姐给我这个机会。后面有什么做的不到位的地方，还得请两位多指点。好，那就这么定了。琳琳李总那边合同已经确定了，后面这个项目你来负责，谢谢王姐，我一定把它做好，有不懂的地方随时问我，王姐怎么了？我还是有点想不明白，这个项目明明是我谈下来的，李总问的业务问题也是我回答的，为什么最后还是玲玲负责？还记得你前几天问我什么吗？你问我为什么玲玲能当经理？你不能现在你还觉得只要每天来得早，走的晚，业务做的好就一定适合当经理吗？业务上你不比玲玲差，甚至谈项目的时候，你表现的很好。但经理这个位置不只是自己把事情做好，还要面对客户、合作方照顾团队，处理各种突发情况。昨天晚上陈总突然问玲玲，你是领导吗？如果换成你，你知道怎么接吗？半杯酒的事儿，如果换成你呢，可能先道歉。所以我让玲玲当经理不是因为他比你更会说漂亮话，是因为很多时候他知道什么时候该说什么，遇到事情也知道该怎么处理。现在你自己告诉我为什么这个位置，我让玲玲来坐，我好像明白了，不服没关系，看明白差距，才能知道自己下一步该往哪儿走。琳琳，嗯，刚开始你当经理，我确实不服，我一直觉得我比你来的早，走的晚，业务也不比你差。但这两天我仔细想了想，我现在服了这么快就服了。业务上的问题我会答，但一碰到人情世故，临场应变，我确实不如你。不过我还有个问题，你说李总夸我的时候，我把功劳给了王姐。李总夸你的时候，你也把功劳给了王姐，为什么？结果完全不一样？七、因为谦虚不等于否定自己啊，你可以抬高别人，但没必要把自己压下去。什么意思？比如李总夸你，后生可畏，你可以说李总您过奖了，要不是您愿意给机会，我哪能跟您这么有魄力的人合作啊，以后还得跟您多学呢。这样既抬高了李总，也没有否定自己的能力，可昨天那些情况呢？陈总突然问你，你是领导吗？还有酒突然只剩半杯，这些总没人提前告诉你吧？当然没有。那你为什么每次马上就知道怎么接，你别告诉我，全是你临床现想的当然不是。那你到底怎么练的？其实我以前跟你一样，不爱说话，也不爱争辩。一到这种场合，别人突然问我一句，我脑子里明明有话，就是不知道怎么说，你以前也这样。当然后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处，它里面很多都是我们平时真的会碰到的场景，别人怎么说你可以怎么接，都是一句一句给你举例，我就一个场景，一个场景的看一个场景，一个场景的练。所以你昨天那些话，很多都是平时慢慢积累出来的。比如别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友呢？别人说你真聪明，你可以回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了。领导跟你说辛苦了，也可以回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若兵，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？难怪你每次都能接的这么快，这种东西真不是天生的，每天不用看很多看两页，慢慢积累，不同场景下该怎么说怎么接。这里面还有很多生活里的场景，比如对象给你发红包，你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。同事向你借钱，你又不想借，可以回，大家都是一样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，你可以回随便想，千万别跟我客气，目前不收费。呵呵这个有意思。我第一次看到这些的时候，也有种豁然开朗的感觉。工作、生活、人际交往里经常碰到的场景，他都会一个一个拆开给你看看的多了，再碰到类似的事情，至少不会一下子不知道该说什么。这本先借我看看，拿去吧，回去慢慢看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 1470,
      "text": "我跟大家宣布一件事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1750,
      "end_ms": 2650,
      "text": "从今天开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2930,
      "end_ms": 4830,
      "text": "琳琳就是我们销售部的经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5070,
      "end_ms": 6025,
      "text": "大家鼓掌祝贺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00005",
      "start_ms": 11480,
      "end_ms": 12140,
      "text": "谢谢王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12140,
      "end_ms": 12935,
      "text": "也谢谢大家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16860,
      "end_ms": 18780,
      "text": "王姐怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20080,
      "end_ms": 21500,
      "text": "我有件事想不明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22460,
      "end_ms": 24920,
      "text": "你说凭什么玲玲能当经理？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00010",
      "start_ms": 25320,
      "end_ms": 28640,
      "text": "我不能我俩可是同时进公司的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00011",
      "start_ms": 28840,
      "end_ms": 30040,
      "text": "我每天来的比他早，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30040,
      "end_ms": 30860,
      "text": "走的比他晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00013",
      "start_ms": 31140,
      "end_ms": 32420,
      "text": "业务上我也没比他差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00014",
      "start_ms": 32700,
      "end_ms": 34320,
      "text": "为什么这个位置不能让我来做？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00015",
      "start_ms": 34800,
      "end_ms": 35400,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00016",
      "start_ms": 36000,
      "end_ms": 38220,
      "text": "你平时的努力大家都看得到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00017",
      "start_ms": 38880,
      "end_ms": 42660,
      "text": "但是工作可不是光靠勤奋就能做好的那还要靠什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00018",
      "start_ms": 43080,
      "end_ms": 45340,
      "text": "正好明天李总那边有个项目要谈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00019",
      "start_ms": 45920,
      "end_ms": 48330,
      "text": "你跟玲玲一起跟我去什么项目。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00020",
      "start_ms": 50670,
      "end_ms": 55290,
      "text": "一千万这个项目李总很重视，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00021",
      "start_ms": 55770,
      "end_ms": 56790,
      "text": "明天你俩都去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00022",
      "start_ms": 56990,
      "end_ms": 58490,
      "text": "至于你刚才问我的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00023",
      "start_ms": 59530,
      "end_ms": 60225,
      "text": "先别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00024",
      "start_ms": 61180,
      "end_ms": 62540,
      "text": "等这个项目结束以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00025",
      "start_ms": 62740,
      "end_ms": 63995,
      "text": "你自己告诉我答案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00026",
      "start_ms": 64660,
      "end_ms": 65125,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00027",
      "start_ms": 66040,
      "end_ms": 68125,
      "text": "那我就看看我到底差在哪儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00028",
      "start_ms": 71350,
      "end_ms": 71895,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00029",
      "start_ms": 72270,
      "end_ms": 73905,
      "text": "王姐一路辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00030",
      "start_ms": 75600,
      "end_ms": 77060,
      "text": "关于这个项目的供应链充值，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00031",
      "start_ms": 77060,
      "end_ms": 78060,
      "text": "你们有什么具体方案，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00032",
      "start_ms": 78080,
      "end_ms": 79200,
      "text": "我们做了两套预案。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00033",
      "start_ms": 79280,
      "end_ms": 80500,
      "text": "一是通过集中采购，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00034",
      "start_ms": 80520,
      "end_ms": 81460,
      "text": "降低原材料成本。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00035",
      "start_ms": 81580,
      "end_ms": 82760,
      "text": "二是优化物流路线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00036",
      "start_ms": 82940,
      "end_ms": 84945,
      "text": "预计能压缩百分之十五的损耗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00037",
      "start_ms": 89880,
      "end_ms": 90555,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00038",
      "start_ms": 91150,
      "end_ms": 93670,
      "text": "你是第一个十来分钟就能把项目谈下来的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00039",
      "start_ms": 93910,
      "end_ms": 95070,
      "text": "真是后生可畏啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00040",
      "start_ms": 95070,
      "end_ms": 97295,
      "text": "哪里哪里还是我们王姐厉害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00041",
      "start_ms": 97530,
      "end_ms": 98555,
      "text": "我就是个打辅助的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00042",
      "start_ms": 102200,
      "end_ms": 103060,
      "text": "好好合同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00043",
      "start_ms": 103060,
      "end_ms": 104165,
      "text": "今天先不着急签，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00044",
      "start_ms": 104740,
      "end_ms": 106255,
      "text": "李总还有什么问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00045",
      "start_ms": 106550,
      "end_ms": 108730,
      "text": "没什么这么大的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00046",
      "start_ms": 108890,
      "end_ms": 109915,
      "text": "我再考虑考虑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00047",
      "start_ms": 110600,
      "end_ms": 111085,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00048",
      "start_ms": 111470,
      "end_ms": 113020,
      "text": "这正好明天晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00049",
      "start_ms": 113020,
      "end_ms": 114470,
      "text": "我组了个局陈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00050",
      "start_ms": 114470,
      "end_ms": 115295,
      "text": "总也会过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00051",
      "start_ms": 115860,
      "end_ms": 118175,
      "text": "王姐要是有时间一起吃个饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00052",
      "start_ms": 119380,
      "end_ms": 120265,
      "text": "李总邀请，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00053",
      "start_ms": 120620,
      "end_ms": 121515,
      "text": "那肯定有时间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00054",
      "start_ms": 123180,
      "end_ms": 123505,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00055",
      "start_ms": 124470,
      "end_ms": 125490,
      "text": "那项目的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00056",
      "start_ms": 125510,
      "end_ms": 126495,
      "text": "咱们明天再聊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00057",
      "start_ms": 128750,
      "end_ms": 129165,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00058",
      "start_ms": 130900,
      "end_ms": 132540,
      "text": "刚才项目不是都已经谈好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00059",
      "start_ms": 132580,
      "end_ms": 133595,
      "text": "合同都准备签了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00060",
      "start_ms": 133990,
      "end_ms": 138030,
      "text": "李总怎么突然又说要考虑你自己想想刚才说什么了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00061",
      "start_ms": 138170,
      "end_ms": 139325,
      "text": "我也没说什么啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00062",
      "start_ms": 139680,
      "end_ms": 140460,
      "text": "李总夸我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00063",
      "start_ms": 140580,
      "end_ms": 141715,
      "text": "我就是谦虚了一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00064",
      "start_ms": 142040,
      "end_ms": 143220,
      "text": "总不能人家夸我两句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00065",
      "start_ms": 143220,
      "end_ms": 144035,
      "text": "我还真认了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00066",
      "start_ms": 144480,
      "end_ms": 146935,
      "text": "李总夸你是认可你的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00067",
      "start_ms": 147450,
      "end_ms": 148395,
      "text": "结果你倒好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00068",
      "start_ms": 148780,
      "end_ms": 150000,
      "text": "自己先告诉人家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00069",
      "start_ms": 150120,
      "end_ms": 153145,
      "text": "你就是个打辅助的这句话有什么问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00070",
      "start_ms": 153650,
      "end_ms": 156730,
      "text": "一千万的项目你自己都不敢认自己的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00071",
      "start_ms": 156730,
      "end_ms": 157845,
      "text": "你让客户怎么放心？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00072",
      "start_ms": 158400,
      "end_ms": 159715,
      "text": "就因为这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00073",
      "start_ms": 160090,
      "end_ms": 163055,
      "text": "很多时候人家看的不只是你会不会做事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00074",
      "start_ms": 163570,
      "end_ms": 165235,
      "text": "也看你会不会跟人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00075",
      "start_ms": 166480,
      "end_ms": 168100,
      "text": "那这个项目是不是没戏了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00076",
      "start_ms": 168160,
      "end_ms": 168855,
      "text": "还有机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00077",
      "start_ms": 169240,
      "end_ms": 171495,
      "text": "这个项目光提成都不止一百万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00078",
      "start_ms": 171910,
      "end_ms": 173450,
      "text": "李总既然没有直接拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00079",
      "start_ms": 173610,
      "end_ms": 175110,
      "text": "还主动约了明天的饭局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00080",
      "start_ms": 175270,
      "end_ms": 176705,
      "text": "就说明事情还有转机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00081",
      "start_ms": 177360,
      "end_ms": 179000,
      "text": "能不能把这个项目拿下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00082",
      "start_ms": 179300,
      "end_ms": 185230,
      "text": "就看你们两个明天的表现了哟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00083",
      "start_ms": 185410,
      "end_ms": 186250,
      "text": "王姐来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00084",
      "start_ms": 186350,
      "end_ms": 187195,
      "text": "快坐快坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00085",
      "start_ms": 187690,
      "end_ms": 188455,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00086",
      "start_ms": 188960,
      "end_ms": 190180,
      "text": "让两位久等了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00087",
      "start_ms": 190420,
      "end_ms": 192305,
      "text": "哪里哪里都是自己人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00088",
      "start_ms": 198040,
      "end_ms": 198685,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00089",
      "start_ms": 199130,
      "end_ms": 199770,
      "text": "今天高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00090",
      "start_ms": 199990,
      "end_ms": 202345,
      "text": "刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00091",
      "start_ms": 203170,
      "end_ms": 203410,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00092",
      "start_ms": 203410,
      "end_ms": 205070,
      "text": "那祝大家吃好喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00093",
      "start_ms": 205070,
      "end_ms": 205310,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00094",
      "start_ms": 205530,
      "end_ms": 215435,
      "text": "我先干了王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00095",
      "start_ms": 215920,
      "end_ms": 217405,
      "text": "那我也借这个机会说两句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00096",
      "start_ms": 217770,
      "end_ms": 218010,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00097",
      "start_ms": 218330,
      "end_ms": 220695,
      "text": "你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00098",
      "start_ms": 221000,
      "end_ms": 222340,
      "text": "也感谢王姐带我们过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00099",
      "start_ms": 222340,
      "end_ms": 223880,
      "text": "让我们有幸认识各位前辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00100",
      "start_ms": 224040,
      "end_ms": 224720,
      "text": "我叫玲玲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00101",
      "start_ms": 224780,
      "end_ms": 225300,
      "text": "俗话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00102",
      "start_ms": 225400,
      "end_ms": 226735,
      "text": "相聚是一种缘分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00103",
      "start_ms": 227050,
      "end_ms": 227690,
      "text": "此时此刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00104",
      "start_ms": 227690,
      "end_ms": 229875,
      "text": "我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00105",
      "start_ms": 230320,
      "end_ms": 231700,
      "text": "祝各位扶摇直上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00106",
      "start_ms": 231720,
      "end_ms": 232220,
      "text": "九万里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00107",
      "start_ms": 232380,
      "end_ms": 233820,
      "text": "事业长虹节节高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00108",
      "start_ms": 234900,
      "end_ms": 235375,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00109",
      "start_ms": 235820,
      "end_ms": 236955,
      "text": "这姑娘会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00110",
      "start_ms": 241760,
      "end_ms": 242290,
      "text": "对不对？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00111",
      "start_ms": 245680,
      "end_ms": 246100,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00112",
      "start_ms": 246820,
      "end_ms": 247560,
      "text": "来这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00113",
      "start_ms": 247560,
      "end_ms": 248105,
      "text": "我敬你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00114",
      "start_ms": 250800,
      "end_ms": 251240,
      "text": "陈总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00115",
      "start_ms": 251620,
      "end_ms": 252960,
      "text": "这杯我替王姐敬您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00116",
      "start_ms": 253480,
      "end_ms": 254880,
      "text": "我敬的是你们领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00117",
      "start_ms": 255400,
      "end_ms": 256380,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00118",
      "start_ms": 256780,
      "end_ms": 257700,
      "text": "瞧您说的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00119",
      "start_ms": 258000,
      "end_ms": 259120,
      "text": "您敬的是我领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00120",
      "start_ms": 259300,
      "end_ms": 260980,
      "text": "我同样敬的也是领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00121",
      "start_ms": 261140,
      "end_ms": 262240,
      "text": "您敬领导是心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00122",
      "start_ms": 262380,
      "end_ms": 264020,
      "text": "我敬您是尊敬这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00123",
      "start_ms": 264280,
      "end_ms": 265260,
      "text": "我敬的是生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00124",
      "start_ms": 265260,
      "end_ms": 265880,
      "text": "咱们随意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00125",
      "start_ms": 266120,
      "end_ms": 267500,
      "text": "祝您生意一路长虹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00126",
      "start_ms": 267540,
      "end_ms": 268220,
      "text": "万事顺利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00127",
      "start_ms": 270300,
      "end_ms": 271680,
      "text": "这小姑娘会说话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00128",
      "start_ms": 271720,
      "end_ms": 273300,
      "text": "琳琳刚才说的不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00129",
      "start_ms": 273340,
      "end_ms": 274280,
      "text": "来咱俩喝一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00130",
      "start_ms": 274340,
      "end_ms": 275125,
      "text": "谢谢陈总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00131",
      "start_ms": 278620,
      "end_ms": 280300,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00132",
      "start_ms": 280320,
      "end_ms": 281620,
      "text": "陈总瓶底酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00133",
      "start_ms": 281620,
      "end_ms": 282560,
      "text": "这叫发财酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00134",
      "start_ms": 282700,
      "end_ms": 283760,
      "text": "到底发财好事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00135",
      "start_ms": 283760,
      "end_ms": 286680,
      "text": "再来好一个发财酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00136",
      "start_ms": 287020,
      "end_ms": 287400,
      "text": "琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00137",
      "start_ms": 288020,
      "end_ms": 289440,
      "text": "你这姑娘反应挺快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00138",
      "start_ms": 290160,
      "end_ms": 293705,
      "text": "王姐手底下有你这样的员工省心啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00139",
      "start_ms": 295190,
      "end_ms": 295530,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00140",
      "start_ms": 295530,
      "end_ms": 296230,
      "text": "您过奖了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00141",
      "start_ms": 296510,
      "end_ms": 299750,
      "text": "主要是王姐平时带的好强将手下吴若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00142",
      "start_ms": 299990,
      "end_ms": 301770,
      "text": "我总不能给我们王姐丢脸呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00143",
      "start_ms": 302930,
      "end_ms": 303390,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00144",
      "start_ms": 303790,
      "end_ms": 305470,
      "text": "你手底下这个姑娘不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00145",
      "start_ms": 305810,
      "end_ms": 307810,
      "text": "年轻人还得多跟您学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00146",
      "start_ms": 307930,
      "end_ms": 313440,
      "text": "啊啊啊王姐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00147",
      "start_ms": 313740,
      "end_ms": 314200,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00148",
      "start_ms": 314300,
      "end_ms": 317120,
      "text": "您说昨天那个一千万的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00149",
      "start_ms": 318120,
      "end_ms": 319040,
      "text": "我考虑好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00150",
      "start_ms": 319280,
      "end_ms": 320540,
      "text": "项目可以继续合作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00151",
      "start_ms": 320900,
      "end_ms": 321960,
      "text": "不过我有个条件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00152",
      "start_ms": 322800,
      "end_ms": 323220,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00153",
      "start_ms": 323340,
      "end_ms": 326645,
      "text": "您说这个项目后面我希望让琳琳来负责。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00154",
      "start_ms": 329290,
      "end_ms": 329750,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00155",
      "start_ms": 329850,
      "end_ms": 332910,
      "text": "我对小张的业务能力没问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00156",
      "start_ms": 333550,
      "end_ms": 335190,
      "text": "这一点昨天我就看出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00157",
      "start_ms": 335510,
      "end_ms": 338770,
      "text": "不过这么大的项目后面少不了跟各种人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00158",
      "start_ms": 338790,
      "end_ms": 342590,
      "text": "今天晚上我也一直在观察你们两个这个项目交给琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00159",
      "start_ms": 342590,
      "end_ms": 343250,
      "text": "我更放心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00160",
      "start_ms": 344290,
      "end_ms": 345230,
      "text": "谢谢李总信任，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00161",
      "start_ms": 345310,
      "end_ms": 346710,
      "text": "也谢谢王姐给我这个机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00162",
      "start_ms": 346970,
      "end_ms": 348690,
      "text": "后面有什么做的不到位的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00163",
      "start_ms": 348690,
      "end_ms": 349650,
      "text": "还得请两位多指点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00164",
      "start_ms": 349910,
      "end_ms": 350150,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00165",
      "start_ms": 350630,
      "end_ms": 351595,
      "text": "那就这么定了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00166",
      "start_ms": 355230,
      "end_ms": 358210,
      "text": "琳琳李总那边合同已经确定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00167",
      "start_ms": 358250,
      "end_ms": 359590,
      "text": "后面这个项目你来负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00168",
      "start_ms": 360210,
      "end_ms": 360950,
      "text": "谢谢王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00169",
      "start_ms": 361110,
      "end_ms": 362010,
      "text": "我一定把它做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00170",
      "start_ms": 362190,
      "end_ms": 363505,
      "text": "有不懂的地方随时问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00171",
      "start_ms": 367650,
      "end_ms": 369910,
      "text": "王姐怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00172",
      "start_ms": 370030,
      "end_ms": 371250,
      "text": "我还是有点想不明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00173",
      "start_ms": 371490,
      "end_ms": 373230,
      "text": "这个项目明明是我谈下来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00174",
      "start_ms": 373310,
      "end_ms": 375070,
      "text": "李总问的业务问题也是我回答的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00175",
      "start_ms": 375070,
      "end_ms": 376450,
      "text": "为什么最后还是玲玲负责？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00176",
      "start_ms": 377110,
      "end_ms": 379030,
      "text": "还记得你前几天问我什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00177",
      "start_ms": 380270,
      "end_ms": 382850,
      "text": "你问我为什么玲玲能当经理？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00178",
      "start_ms": 382930,
      "end_ms": 386330,
      "text": "你不能现在你还觉得只要每天来得早，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00179",
      "start_ms": 386430,
      "end_ms": 386990,
      "text": "走的晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00180",
      "start_ms": 387070,
      "end_ms": 389190,
      "text": "业务做的好就一定适合当经理吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00181",
      "start_ms": 389850,
      "end_ms": 391770,
      "text": "业务上你不比玲玲差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00182",
      "start_ms": 392090,
      "end_ms": 393450,
      "text": "甚至谈项目的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00183",
      "start_ms": 393530,
      "end_ms": 394590,
      "text": "你表现的很好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00184",
      "start_ms": 394810,
      "end_ms": 397860,
      "text": "但经理这个位置不只是自己把事情做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00185",
      "start_ms": 398020,
      "end_ms": 400480,
      "text": "还要面对客户、合作方照顾团队，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00186",
      "start_ms": 400600,
      "end_ms": 401920,
      "text": "处理各种突发情况。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00187",
      "start_ms": 402180,
      "end_ms": 403940,
      "text": "昨天晚上陈总突然问玲玲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00188",
      "start_ms": 404200,
      "end_ms": 405080,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00189",
      "start_ms": 405200,
      "end_ms": 406100,
      "text": "如果换成你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00190",
      "start_ms": 406280,
      "end_ms": 407300,
      "text": "你知道怎么接吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00191",
      "start_ms": 407600,
      "end_ms": 408680,
      "text": "半杯酒的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00192",
      "start_ms": 408680,
      "end_ms": 409620,
      "text": "如果换成你呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00193",
      "start_ms": 409980,
      "end_ms": 411180,
      "text": "可能先道歉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00194",
      "start_ms": 411780,
      "end_ms": 415020,
      "text": "所以我让玲玲当经理不是因为他比你更会说漂亮话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00195",
      "start_ms": 415260,
      "end_ms": 418000,
      "text": "是因为很多时候他知道什么时候该说什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00196",
      "start_ms": 418120,
      "end_ms": 419915,
      "text": "遇到事情也知道该怎么处理。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00197",
      "start_ms": 420670,
      "end_ms": 423380,
      "text": "现在你自己告诉我为什么这个位置，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00198",
      "start_ms": 423380,
      "end_ms": 424475,
      "text": "我让玲玲来坐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00199",
      "start_ms": 426330,
      "end_ms": 427275,
      "text": "我好像明白了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00200",
      "start_ms": 428860,
      "end_ms": 429795,
      "text": "不服没关系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00201",
      "start_ms": 430360,
      "end_ms": 431285,
      "text": "看明白差距，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00202",
      "start_ms": 431610,
      "end_ms": 433435,
      "text": "才能知道自己下一步该往哪儿走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00203",
      "start_ms": 438530,
      "end_ms": 438915,
      "text": "琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00204",
      "start_ms": 439220,
      "end_ms": 439535,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00205",
      "start_ms": 440290,
      "end_ms": 441170,
      "text": "刚开始你当经理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00206",
      "start_ms": 441170,
      "end_ms": 441955,
      "text": "我确实不服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00207",
      "start_ms": 442390,
      "end_ms": 443810,
      "text": "我一直觉得我比你来的早，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00208",
      "start_ms": 443810,
      "end_ms": 444330,
      "text": "走的晚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00209",
      "start_ms": 444450,
      "end_ms": 445535,
      "text": "业务也不比你差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00210",
      "start_ms": 446030,
      "end_ms": 447425,
      "text": "但这两天我仔细想了想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00211",
      "start_ms": 448500,
      "end_ms": 451630,
      "text": "我现在服了这么快就服了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00212",
      "start_ms": 451830,
      "end_ms": 453115,
      "text": "业务上的问题我会答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00213",
      "start_ms": 453440,
      "end_ms": 454540,
      "text": "但一碰到人情世故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00214",
      "start_ms": 454580,
      "end_ms": 455300,
      "text": "临场应变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00215",
      "start_ms": 455500,
      "end_ms": 456415,
      "text": "我确实不如你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00216",
      "start_ms": 457350,
      "end_ms": 458405,
      "text": "不过我还有个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00217",
      "start_ms": 458820,
      "end_ms": 460490,
      "text": "你说李总夸我的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00218",
      "start_ms": 460490,
      "end_ms": 461555,
      "text": "我把功劳给了王姐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00219",
      "start_ms": 461870,
      "end_ms": 462750,
      "text": "李总夸你的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00220",
      "start_ms": 462750,
      "end_ms": 464005,
      "text": "你也把功劳给了王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00221",
      "start_ms": 464270,
      "end_ms": 464630,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00222",
      "start_ms": 464630,
      "end_ms": 465565,
      "text": "结果完全不一样？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00223",
      "start_ms": 466030,
      "end_ms": 469020,
      "text": "七、因为谦虚不等于否定自己啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00224",
      "start_ms": 469080,
      "end_ms": 470080,
      "text": "你可以抬高别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00225",
      "start_ms": 470080,
      "end_ms": 471380,
      "text": "但没必要把自己压下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00226",
      "start_ms": 471480,
      "end_ms": 472095,
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00227",
      "start_ms": 472440,
      "end_ms": 473280,
      "text": "比如李总夸你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00228",
      "start_ms": 473280,
      "end_ms": 474125,
      "text": "后生可畏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00229",
      "start_ms": 474580,
      "end_ms": 477335,
      "text": "你可以说李总您过奖了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00230",
      "start_ms": 477620,
      "end_ms": 479000,
      "text": "要不是您愿意给机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00231",
      "start_ms": 479080,
      "end_ms": 481295,
      "text": "我哪能跟您这么有魄力的人合作啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00232",
      "start_ms": 481530,
      "end_ms": 482825,
      "text": "以后还得跟您多学呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00233",
      "start_ms": 483110,
      "end_ms": 484345,
      "text": "这样既抬高了李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00234",
      "start_ms": 484740,
      "end_ms": 486215,
      "text": "也没有否定自己的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00235",
      "start_ms": 487480,
      "end_ms": 488695,
      "text": "可昨天那些情况呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00236",
      "start_ms": 489100,
      "end_ms": 490100,
      "text": "陈总突然问你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00237",
      "start_ms": 490160,
      "end_ms": 491165,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00238",
      "start_ms": 491640,
      "end_ms": 493355,
      "text": "还有酒突然只剩半杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00239",
      "start_ms": 494180,
      "end_ms": 495765,
      "text": "这些总没人提前告诉你吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00240",
      "start_ms": 496150,
      "end_ms": 496925,
      "text": "当然没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00241",
      "start_ms": 497260,
      "end_ms": 498905,
      "text": "那你为什么每次马上就知道怎么接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00242",
      "start_ms": 500100,
      "end_ms": 500840,
      "text": "你别告诉我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00243",
      "start_ms": 500840,
      "end_ms": 503265,
      "text": "全是你临床现想的当然不是。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00244",
      "start_ms": 503740,
      "end_ms": 504835,
      "text": "那你到底怎么练的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00245",
      "start_ms": 505200,
      "end_ms": 506575,
      "text": "其实我以前跟你一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00246",
      "start_ms": 506930,
      "end_ms": 507570,
      "text": "不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00247",
      "start_ms": 507730,
      "end_ms": 508570,
      "text": "也不爱争辩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00248",
      "start_ms": 508830,
      "end_ms": 509810,
      "text": "一到这种场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00249",
      "start_ms": 509930,
      "end_ms": 511165,
      "text": "别人突然问我一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00250",
      "start_ms": 511490,
      "end_ms": 512710,
      "text": "我脑子里明明有话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00251",
      "start_ms": 512870,
      "end_ms": 513850,
      "text": "就是不知道怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00252",
      "start_ms": 514110,
      "end_ms": 515065,
      "text": "你以前也这样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00253",
      "start_ms": 515690,
      "end_ms": 520255,
      "text": "当然后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00254",
      "start_ms": 520650,
      "end_ms": 523565,
      "text": "它里面很多都是我们平时真的会碰到的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00255",
      "start_ms": 523910,
      "end_ms": 525630,
      "text": "别人怎么说你可以怎么接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00256",
      "start_ms": 525750,
      "end_ms": 527270,
      "text": "都是一句一句给你举例，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00257",
      "start_ms": 527410,
      "end_ms": 528290,
      "text": "我就一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00258",
      "start_ms": 528290,
      "end_ms": 529930,
      "text": "一个场景的看一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00259",
      "start_ms": 529930,
      "end_ms": 530645,
      "text": "一个场景的练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00260",
      "start_ms": 531690,
      "end_ms": 532810,
      "text": "所以你昨天那些话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00261",
      "start_ms": 533170,
      "end_ms": 535374,
      "text": "很多都是平时慢慢积累出来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00262",
      "start_ms": 535620,
      "end_ms": 536820,
      "text": "比如别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00263",
      "start_ms": 536880,
      "end_ms": 537545,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00264",
      "start_ms": 537880,
      "end_ms": 538845,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00265",
      "start_ms": 539020,
      "end_ms": 540135,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00266",
      "start_ms": 540390,
      "end_ms": 541510,
      "text": "别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00267",
      "start_ms": 541590,
      "end_ms": 543290,
      "text": "你可以回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00268",
      "start_ms": 543430,
      "end_ms": 544350,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00269",
      "start_ms": 544370,
      "end_ms": 545430,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00270",
      "start_ms": 545470,
      "end_ms": 546690,
      "text": "领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00271",
      "start_ms": 546690,
      "end_ms": 548000,
      "text": "也可以回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00272",
      "start_ms": 548000,
      "end_ms": 549205,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00273",
      "start_ms": 549430,
      "end_ms": 550590,
      "text": "强将手下吴若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00274",
      "start_ms": 550590,
      "end_ms": 551925,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00275",
      "start_ms": 552250,
      "end_ms": 553910,
      "text": "难怪你每次都能接的这么快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00276",
      "start_ms": 554110,
      "end_ms": 555685,
      "text": "这种东西真不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00277",
      "start_ms": 555940,
      "end_ms": 557605,
      "text": "每天不用看很多看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00278",
      "start_ms": 557870,
      "end_ms": 558450,
      "text": "慢慢积累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00279",
      "start_ms": 558450,
      "end_ms": 560425,
      "text": "不同场景下该怎么说怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00280",
      "start_ms": 560690,
      "end_ms": 562525,
      "text": "这里面还有很多生活里的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00281",
      "start_ms": 562800,
      "end_ms": 564040,
      "text": "比如对象给你发红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00282",
      "start_ms": 564040,
      "end_ms": 566820,
      "text": "你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00283",
      "start_ms": 567080,
      "end_ms": 568120,
      "text": "同事向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00284",
      "start_ms": 568180,
      "end_ms": 568900,
      "text": "你又不想借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00285",
      "start_ms": 568980,
      "end_ms": 569525,
      "text": "可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00286",
      "start_ms": 569840,
      "end_ms": 571180,
      "text": "大家都是一样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00287",
      "start_ms": 571220,
      "end_ms": 571700,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00288",
      "start_ms": 571700,
      "end_ms": 572545,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00289",
      "start_ms": 573640,
      "end_ms": 575875,
      "text": "还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00290",
      "start_ms": 576080,
      "end_ms": 577730,
      "text": "你可以回随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00291",
      "start_ms": 577890,
      "end_ms": 579010,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00292",
      "start_ms": 579090,
      "end_ms": 579975,
      "text": "目前不收费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00293",
      "start_ms": 580640,
      "end_ms": 582465,
      "text": "呵呵这个有意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00294",
      "start_ms": 582850,
      "end_ms": 584290,
      "text": "我第一次看到这些的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00295",
      "start_ms": 584290,
      "end_ms": 585895,
      "text": "也有种豁然开朗的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00296",
      "start_ms": 586290,
      "end_ms": 589275,
      "text": "工作、生活、人际交往里经常碰到的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00297",
      "start_ms": 589890,
      "end_ms": 592645,
      "text": "他都会一个一个拆开给你看看的多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00298",
      "start_ms": 592930,
      "end_ms": 594075,
      "text": "再碰到类似的事情，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00299",
      "start_ms": 594400,
      "end_ms": 596640,
      "text": "至少不会一下子不知道该说什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00300",
      "start_ms": 596680,
      "end_ms": 597675,
      "text": "这本先借我看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00301",
      "start_ms": 598080,
      "end_ms": 598640,
      "text": "拿去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_7c9d47c6f0bcb117_s00302",
      "start_ms": 598660,
      "end_ms": 599465,
      "text": "回去慢慢看。"
    }
  ],
